# UI/UX Pro Max Intelligence

Before generating or styling frontend interfaces:
1. Search styles, fonts, and palettes: `python scripts/search.py "<query>" --domain style|color|typography`
2. Apply strict anti-slop rules: clean Apple/Stripe-level aesthetics, no harsh saturated backgrounds, no informal emojis, pure SVG icons.
3. Keep layout mobile-first with no text collision.
